---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
  <BaseHead
    title="Journey"
    description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
  />
</head>

<body>

  <Header />

  <main>

    <img
      src="/freedom.png"
      alt="Carmela"
      class="photo"
    />

    <p class="intro">
      Finding a place to belong
    </p>

    <p>
      I've never been to Malta before, yet I'm moving there in early September.
      Being retired gives me precious time. Every morning I remind myself,
      "I'm the luckiest person I know." I'm excited to begin a new chapter
      and discover where the journey leads.
    </p>

    <p>
      For a month I plan to join tours, explore different neighborhoods, meet
      people, listen, learn, and simply enjoy the experience. At the same time,
      I'll be looking for a home. I plan to start near Sliema, but very open
      to discovery. I'm open to either a community-style home with my own bedroom
      and bathroom or a furnished apartment.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you know a neighborhood worth exploring, someone renting a place,
      or simply a place I shouldn't miss, I'd love to hear from you.
    </p>

    <img
      src="/SIGNATURE-THICK-NAVY-CLEAR.png"
      alt="Carmela's signature"
      class="signature"
    />

    <p class="email">
      <a href="mailto:contact@ourmalta.org">
        contact@ourmalta.org
      </a>
    </p>

  </main>

</body>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  p {
    color: #1F3A5F;
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }

  .intro {
    color: #1F3A5F;
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .signature {
    display: block;
    width: 166px;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .email {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .email a {
    color: #1F3A5F;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .email a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

</style>

</html>
